    "title": "2025 Parade of Lights call for entries - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editorial Policies Transparency ,\n11 hours ago The Leisure Services Department announces that applications are now being accepted for the 2025 Athens-Clarke County Downtown Parade of Lights. This year’s parade is scheduled for Thursday, December 4 at 7:00 p.m. The deadline for entries is Tuesday, November 4, 2025 at 5:00 p.m. Late applications are not accepted.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
